OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after police fraud
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with a number of
OL,7,Foffences after a police investigation
OL,8,Finto cold-callers and rogue traders in
OL,9,FArmagh, Banbridge and Craigavon.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old faces charges of fraud
OL,12,Fby false representation, obtaining
OL,13,Fproperty by deception, engaging in
OL,14,Faggressive commercial practice,
OL,15,Fpossessing articles used in fraud,
OL,16,Fassault and harassment.
OL,18,FHe was arrested in the Newry Road in
OL,19,FArmagh on Saturday and is due to appear
OL,20,Fbefore Newry Magistrates' Court on
OL,21,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
