OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charge follows a recent PSNI Day of
OL,7,FAction which focused on cold-callers
OL,8,Fand rogue traders across the Armagh,
OL,9,FBanbridge and Craigavon District.
